    {
      "text": "Monochrome photograph of a workshop: a man stands holding papers and presents beside a projection screen, while participants seated at a table listen; a banner behind reads “Tổ chức Y tế Thế giới WHO” and “Hội thảo”, and flip-chart sheets are pinned to the wall.",
